              "text": "aruṇa is the Rigvedic colour of dawn, \"reddish, tawny\" (CDIAL 616). MW takes it from the root √ṛ, while CDIAL suggests, with a question mark, a stem aru-, so the derivation is not settled. Hindi keeps it as arun."
